    "scenesThatPass": [
      "KATE: She did.\nFAITH: I did.",
      "FAITH: Is everything okay?\nKATE: Yes. You know all the shrinks on Donahue say that all those love songs about some enchanted evening are just a cruel hoax that feeds people'…\nFAITH: But somebody wrote those songs.\nKATE: So, what's your point?",
      "FAITH: It was my New Year's resolution to overcome it.\nKATE: But it's July.\nFAITH: It's still the new year...\nKATE: What about your job?",
      "KATE: You really think this is safe?\nFAITH: I'd say so...\nKATE: God, the Catholic Church is even richer than I thought.",
      "FAITH: Yes.\nKATE: I'm married."
    ]
